# Play test of Albatross Field (CIPlay albatross_field, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the runway
# along the west side (x -55, z -44..44, 4.3 m), its lamps on its east edge (x -50, z -36 -12 12 36, south to north);
# the hangars at its south end (-36 -46, -16 -52); the operations hut (relay house x -31..-20.5, z 42.5..53), the
# control tower (x -16..-10, z 45.5..54.5, its cab floor 7.35 m, the stairs up from the north at x -7.96 to the deck at its
# east door) and the power bunker (x -44.5..-35.5, z 54..60) at the runway's north end; the fuel dump on the eastern
# islet (56 0) across the north pass; the ditched fighter 8 m down in the lagoon (5 0)
island Albatross Field
offset -1.6942 -0.1074
expect step 0
expect title Long Patrol
wait 5

# Land on the runway; the commander's order in the operations hut; his footlocker is locked
walk -55 -42 to -55 -28 h=4.3
zone strip
expect step 1
read Commander's last order
expect step 2
open Commander's footlocker
expect message FOR WHOEVER BRINGS THEM HOME

# The screechers come off the hangar roofs; the hangar toolbox
zone hangars
kill Screecher
expect step 3
open Hangar toolbox

# The generator is dry; two drums from the fuel dump on the eastern islet
use generator
expect message tank is dry
open Full fuel drum
open Second full fuel drum
expect story avgas 2
expect step 4

# The power bunker: in through its door, the generator runs - lights in the bunker and the tower's cab
walk -48 57 to -45.5 58.5 to -41.5 57.5 h=4.4 below=6
zone powerbunker
use generator
expect message coughs, catches
expect story avgas 0
expect story power 1
expect step 5
expect shown bunkerlamps
expect shown towerlights

# Dive to the ditched fighter in the lagoon; her cockpit box - the radio crystal
zone ditched
expect step 6
open Lt. Ruiz's cockpit box
expect story crystal 1
expect step 7

# Up the tower's stairs to the deck and into the glass cab; the radio raises the flight
walk -7.96 62 to -7.96 60.5 to -7.96 53.6 h=7.4
walk -7.96 53.6 to -7.4 49.2 to -11.5 49.2 h=7.4 below=10
zone tower
expect step 8
use radio
expect message Long Patrol
expect story landingorder 1
expect step 9

# The runway lamps: not out of order - then south to north; the flight comes home; the footlocker
use lamp3
expect message South to north
use lamp1
expect shown lamp1light
use lamp2
use lamp3
use lamp4
expect shown lamp4light
expect story runwaylit 1
expect step 10
open Commander's footlocker
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Reciever 1
expect done

# The barracks chest, the mess tent's box, the bomber's cargo box on the outer reef
open Barracks chest
open Mess tent box
open Bomber's cargo box
